"The script runs with Python 3, NumPy, and Matplotlib. \\ It identifies "
"Jobs by their contents instead of their filenames, using the atom types "
"and counts in the QE input and the line reporting the vibrational "
"frequency in the Psi4 output. \\ It identifies the Ga adatom adsorption "
"site (T4 or H3) from the coordinates after geometry optimization."

