#: ../../gan_surface/reproduction.rst:198
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Ga原子はスピン分極させ、全磁化を1 :math:`\\mu_\\mathrm{B}` に固定して、整数の占有で計算します。\\ "
"画面にない設定なので、Jobを作った後、実行する前に入力ファイル ``QuloudJob.scf.in`` を直接編集し（Registeredの "
"Job）、 ``&SYSTEM`` と ``&ELECTRONS`` を次のようにします。"
msgstr ""
"Calculate the Ga atom with spin polarization, fix the total magnetization"
" at 1 :math:`\\mu_\\mathrm{B}`, and use integer occupations. \\ Because "
"these settings are unavailable in the interface, after creating the Job "
"and before running it, edit the input file ``QuloudJob.scf.in`` directly "
"while the Job is \"Registered\". Set ``&SYSTEM`` and ``&ELECTRONS`` as "
"follows."

#: ../../gan_surface/reproduction.rst:201
msgid ""
"&SYSTEM\n"
"  ...\n"
"  occupations = 'fixed'\n"
"  nspin = 2\n"
"  tot_magnetization = 1\n"
"  starting_magnetization(1) = 0.5\n"
"  nosym = .true.\n"
"/\n"
"&ELECTRONS\n"
"  conv_thr = 1.0d-6\n"
"  mixing_mode = 'local-TF'\n"
"  mixing_beta = 0.10\n"
"  mixing_ndim = 8\n"
"  electron_maxstep = 200\n"
"/"
msgstr ""
"&SYSTEM\n"
"  ...\n"
"  occupations = 'fixed'\n"
"  nspin = 2\n"
"  tot_magnetization = 1\n"
"  starting_magnetization(1) = 0.5\n"
"  nosym = .true.\n"
"/\n"
"&ELECTRONS\n"
"  conv_thr = 1.0d-6\n"
"  mixing_mode = 'local-TF'\n"
"  mixing_beta = 0.10\n"
"  mixing_ndim = 8\n"
"  electron_maxstep = 200\n"
"/"

#: ../../gan_surface/reproduction.rst:219
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Ga原子のp軌道は3重に縮退しており、1個の電子をどれかに入れる整数の占有ではSCFが収束しにくくなります。\\ 混合の係数（ "
"``mixing_beta`` ）を小さくし、収束閾値をQuloudの既定値の :math:`10^{-6}` Ryにしました。\\ "
"H₂は閉殻なので、 ``occupations = 'fixed'`` にするだけです。\\ 記事の入力は ``K_POINTS gamma`` "
"（Γ点だけの計算）で、k グリッド1、1、1と同じk点です。\\ 記事で使った入力ファイルは、 ``gas_qe.zip`` の各フォルダにある "
"``QuloudJob.scf.in`` です。"
msgstr ""
"The p orbitals of the Ga atom are triply degenerate, which makes SCF "
"convergence difficult when integer occupations place one electron in one "
"of the orbitals. \\ We reduced the mixing coefficient (``mixing_beta``) "
"and used Quloud's default convergence threshold of :math:`10^{-6}` Ry. \\"
" H₂ is closed shell, so the only change needed is ``occupations = "
"'fixed'``. \\ The input used in the article specifies ``K_POINTS gamma`` "
"(Γ point only), which gives the same k-point as a k-grid of 1, 1, 1. \\ "
"Each folder in ``gas_qe.zip`` contains the input file "
"``QuloudJob.scf.in`` used in the article."

#: ../../gan_surface/reproduction.rst:226
msgid "3. 表面スラブの構造最適化（QE）"
msgstr "3. Surface Slab Structure Optimization (QE)"

#: ../../gan_surface/reproduction.rst:228
msgid ""
"4つのスラブ構造の最適化は、Quloudの計算機能「構造最適化（QE）」に相当します。\\ "
"ただし、底面の擬水素を別の種として扱う設定は現在のQuloudではできないため、記事ではQuloudの外で実行しました。\\ "
"記事の計算で使った入力ファイルの要点は次のとおりです（T4サイトの Ga adatom の例、原子の座標は省略）。\\ 全文は "
"``gan_slabs.zip`` の各フォルダにある ``QuloudJob.scf.in`` です。"
msgstr ""
"The geometry optimizations for the four slab structures correspond to "
"\"Geometry Optimization (QE)\" in Quloud. \\ However, the current "
"interface cannot treat the pseudo-hydrogen at the bottom as a separate "
"species, so we ran these calculations outside Quloud. \\ The excerpt "
"below shows the main settings from the input file used in the article for"
" Ga adatom at the T4 site, with atomic coordinates omitted. \\ Each "
"folder in ``gan_slabs.zip`` contains the complete input file, "
"``QuloudJob.scf.in``."

#: ../../gan_surface/reproduction.rst:233
msgid ""
"&CONTROL\n"
"  calculation = 'relax'\n"
"  tprnfor = .true.\n"
"  forc_conv_thr = 1.0e-03\n"
"/\n"
"&SYSTEM\n"
"  ibrav = 0\n"
"  nat = 45\n"
"  ntyp = 3\n"
"  ecutwfc = 70.0\n"
"  ecutrho = 400.0\n"
"  input_dft = 'PBE'\n"
"  occupations = 'fixed'\n"
"/\n"
"&ELECTRONS\n"
"  conv_thr = 1.0e-08\n"
"  mixing_beta = 0.30\n"
"/\n"
"&IONS\n"
"  ion_dynamics = 'bfgs'\n"
"/\n"
"ATOMIC_SPECIES\n"
"Ga    69.72300 Ga.pbe-dn-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF\n"
"N     14.00670 N.pbe-n-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF\n"
"Hn     1.00794 H_N_0.75.PBE.UPF\n"
"\n"
"ATOMIC_POSITIONS angstrom\n"
"Hn        0.0000000000      0.0000000000      9.0000000000 0 0 0\n"
"...\n"
"N         0.0000000000      0.0000000000     10.0000000000 0 0 0\n"
"...\n"
"\n"
"K_POINTS automatic\n"
"3 3 1 0 0 0"
msgstr ""
"&CONTROL\n"
"  calculation = 'relax'\n"
"  tprnfor = .true.\n"
"  forc_conv_thr = 1.0e-03\n"
"/\n"
"&SYSTEM\n"
"  ibrav = 0\n"
"  nat = 45\n"
"  ntyp = 3\n"
"  ecutwfc = 70.0\n"
"  ecutrho = 400.0\n"
"  input_dft = 'PBE'\n"
"  occupations = 'fixed'\n"
"/\n"
"&ELECTRONS\n"
"  conv_thr = 1.0e-08\n"
"  mixing_beta = 0.30\n"
"/\n"
"&IONS\n"
"  ion_dynamics = 'bfgs'\n"
"/\n"
"ATOMIC_SPECIES\n"
"Ga    69.72300 Ga.pbe-dn-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF\n"
"N     14.00670 N.pbe-n-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF\n"
"Hn     1.00794 H_N_0.75.PBE.UPF\n"
"\n"
"ATOMIC_POSITIONS angstrom\n"
"Hn        0.0000000000      0.0000000000      9.0000000000 0 0 0\n"
"...\n"
"N         0.0000000000      0.0000000000     10.0000000000 0 0 0\n"
"...\n"
"\n"
"K_POINTS automatic\n"
"3 3 1 0 0 0"

#: ../../gan_surface/reproduction.rst:270
msgid ""
"底面の擬水素は種 ``Hn`` として ``H_N_0.75.PBE.UPF`` を割り当てます。 3Ga-H では、表面のH原子に種 ``H``"
" （ ``H.pbe-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF`` ）を加え、 ``ntyp = 4`` になります。"
msgstr ""
"Assign the pseudo-hydrogen at the bottom to species ``Hn`` with "
"pseudopotential ``H_N_0.75.PBE.UPF``. For 3Ga-H, add species ``H`` (``H"
".pbe-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF``) for the surface H atoms and set ``ntyp = 4``."

#: ../../gan_surface/reproduction.rst:271
msgid "座標の後ろの ``0 0 0`` は、その原子を固定する指定です。底面の擬水素4個とN原子4個を固定します。"
msgstr ""
"The flags ``0 0 0`` after an atom's coordinates fix that atom in place. "
"Fix the four pseudo-hydrogen atoms and four N atoms at the bottom."

#: ../../gan_surface/reproduction.rst:272
msgid ""
"Ideal だけは電子数が奇数なので、 ``occupations = 'smearing'`` 、 ``smearing = "
"'gaussian'`` 、 ``degauss = 0.01`` です。解析スクリプトは、スメアリングを使った出力では "
":math:`(F+E)/2` を全エネルギーとして使います（ :numref:`tab-gan-conditions` の注）。"
msgstr ""
"Only Ideal has an odd number of electrons, so it uses ``occupations = "
"'smearing'``, ``smearing = 'gaussian'``, and ``degauss = 0.01``. For "
"output with smearing, the analysis script uses :math:`(F+E)/2` as the "
"total energy (see the note to :numref:`tab-gan-conditions`)."

#: ../../gan_surface/reproduction.rst:273
msgid "1件の計算時間は、32 MPIプロセスで15〜31分でした（BFGSで13〜26ステップ）。"
msgstr ""
"Each calculation took 15–31 minutes on 32 MPI processes (13–26 BFGS "
"steps)."

